/T (Unnormalised form. If everything were kept in one sheet, each row would repeat the farmer's name, phone and village, the animal's breed, and the price per litre on every delivery. Changing a farmer's phone number would mean editing many rows, and deleting the last delivery of a farmer would erase the farmer's details.)
/E (Unnormalised form. If everything were kept in one sheet, each row would repeat the farmer's name, phone and village, the animal's breed, and the price per litre on every delivery. Changing a farmer's phone number would mean editing many rows, and deleting the last delivery of a farmer would erase the farmer's details.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [15]
>>
