/Title (Dairy cooperatives and milk-collection centres gather milk twice a day from many small farmers. Each collection has to be measured for quantity, fat percentage and SNF \(solids-not-fat\) percentage, priced according to a rate chart, and eventually paid out to the farmer. In many centres this information still lives in paper registers or unconnected spreadsheets, which leads to lost records, slow payment calculation and no reliable health history for the animals.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2021 0 R
/Next 2315 0 R
>>
