2315 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project designs and implements a relational database, dairy_farm_db, for a dairy farm herd and milk collection system. The database has six normalised tables \(Farmer, Cattle, Milk Collection, Rate Chart, Payment and Health Record\) linked by primary and foreign keys. A web interface built with HTML, CSS and JavaScript, served by a Node.js and Express backend, connects to MySQL and lets a user view, insert and delete records in every table. The amount due to each farmer is calculated entirely in SQL by joining collection entries to the rate band that matches the fat percentage.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2021 0 R
/Prev 2212 0 R
/Next 2316 0 R
>>
endobj
2316 0 obj
<<
/Title (The report covers the ER model, the relational schema and its normalization to Third Normal Form, the data dictionary, the DDL and DML commands, sample queries with their outputs, the user interface, implementation details and a test plan.)
